    "updated_at": "2025-11-18T12:42:46Z",
    "body": "2 is a variant that seems reasonable with the understanding that it's scoped to dictionary compression. We also have to track that response header across redirects, which will require some novel logic I think (as currently we'd just block at the earliest response lacking it as we're in a COEP context).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
