    "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:15:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-18T15:15:47Z",
    "body": "I don't see why we would exclude this case from redirect tracking. We employ that everywhere. The attack scenario is involved, but I don't see why that would mean we don't want to defend against confused deputies.",
